      "writtenOn": "2024-10-31T20:06:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "https://source.corp.google.com/h/prodkernel/kernel/upstream/torvalds/linux-2.6/+/master:include/net/inet_sock.h;drc\u003da2dc7bee4f77266ebb8e3a8544fc5f7812835f8c;l\u003d112\n\nstatic inline u32 inet_request_mark(const struct sock *sk, struct sk_buff *skb)\n{\n\tu32 mark \u003d READ_ONCE(sk-\u003esk_mark);\n\n\tif (!mark \u0026\u0026 READ_ONCE(sock_net(sk)-\u003eipv4.sysctl_tcp_fwmark_accept))\n\t\treturn skb-\u003emark;\n\n\treturn mark;\n}\n\nso tcp fwmark accept only happens if the sk_mark is zero",
